    "overview": "This descriptive name captures the implemented interface: a light, quiet place to record personal readings, with confident typography and a restrained cool palette. It describes the existing system rather than introducing a new brand direction.\n\nThe visual character comes from blue-white space, cornflower actions, powder-blue completion cues and thin dividers. Information is compact but clearly grouped; large reading values and bold headings establish hierarchy without decorative illustrations. Motion marks loading and successful actions without competing with the data.",
